WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.320 --> 01:30.080
I will now announce your grades.

01:31.720 --> 01:33.820
Vanilla: 130,000 Ecure.

01:33.820 --> 01:34.860
Yay!

01:35.420 --> 01:37.540
Chocolat: 80,000 Ecure.

01:37.540 --> 01:38.450
Yay!

01:40.930 --> 01:43.060
This match is already decided.

01:44.370 --> 01:47.000
No matter what you do you will not catch up.

01:47.870 --> 01:51.420
That's not true ~ kero, we will recover ~ kero.

01:51.420 --> 01:54.380
This is not over yet, right!

01:54.980 --> 01:57.040
That's right, there is still a long way to go.

01:57.610 --> 02:00.580
That's why Chocolat still has many chances to come.

02:03.250 --> 02:06.480
There might be some disturbance
made by the Ogres like last time,

02:06.480 --> 02:08.350
but leave the ogre problem to us.

02:09.060 --> 02:12.190
You two concentrate on your
training to become Queen.

02:12.790 --> 02:13.820
Yes!

02:14.830 --> 02:19.490
It is not permitted to bring the disputes
of the Magical World to the Human World.

02:20.600 --> 02:25.570
Pierre has targeted Chocolat, and even
though he goes to the same school,

02:27.040 --> 02:28.780
you are not to get close to him.

02:40.260 --> 02:42.890
Vanilla, let's do our best together until the end.

02:43.420 --> 02:43.850
Yes!

02:51.430 --> 02:54.000
The Annoying Witch Waffle Makes Her Appearance!

02:57.540 --> 02:59.010
Wait for me Chocolat-chan.

03:00.410 --> 03:04.480
I wonder if it is alright to use the magical
broom to transport to a human school.

03:05.150 --> 03:09.480
But you just got your magical
broom from Queen Candy,

03:09.480 --> 03:11.190
not using it would be a waste.

03:15.060 --> 03:20.040
Well, Chocolat and Vanilla, if you girls learn
to fly without using a broom like us,

03:20.040 --> 03:22.550
you will be considered to be a mature witch.

03:22.860 --> 03:23.800
That's right.

03:24.900 --> 03:28.020
Just because you two are a little
better at using magic...!

03:32.910 --> 03:33.780
What's that?

03:33.780 --> 03:34.360
Who is that?

03:34.740 --> 03:35.640
Musasabi?

03:34.740 --> 03:36.480
Musasabi – Japanese giant flying squirrel

03:36.010 --> 03:37.110
Watch out!

03:37.110 --> 03:39.000
Houx-sama!

03:39.450 --> 03:40.710
Ehh~?

03:41.780 --> 03:42.700
Houx!

03:46.450 --> 03:48.360
Bi, let's go.

04:01.540 --> 04:02.180
And you are?

04:03.040 --> 04:05.310
Waffle-sama are you alight?

04:05.310 --> 04:07.110
Houx, are you ok?

04:07.110 --> 04:10.150
Nana, Houx-sama saved me.

04:10.850 --> 04:14.950
The one who saved you is your familiar,
the giant flying squirrel.

04:16.680 --> 04:17.480
Who is she?

04:20.320 --> 04:22.490
I'm Waffle~ desu!

04:23.180 --> 04:24.530
Waffle?

04:24.530 --> 04:25.930
You came from Magical World, didn't you?

04:26.490 --> 04:28.760
I'm in the Bat Class from Santoru Kou.

04:29.330 --> 04:31.700
That means that she is two grades bellow Chocolat.

04:32.400 --> 04:33.240
Indeed!

04:33.240 --> 04:39.340
Waffle-sama's father is a clerk in the Senate and her mother is the palace's court lady.

04:39.340 --> 04:41.040
None of that matters!

04:41.610 --> 04:43.510
What's important is that I...

04:44.480 --> 04:49.220
I am the girl that had a fateful encounter
with Houx-sama one year ago.

04:50.250 --> 04:51.120
Ehh?!

04:51.810 --> 04:53.850
When did you do such a thing?

04:54.360 --> 04:55.390
Fateful...?

04:55.390 --> 04:56.310
Encounter...?

04:56.720 --> 04:58.630
Isn't that right, Houx-sama?

04:59.230 --> 05:00.560
I don't remember that.

05:02.110 --> 05:03.830
No way!!

05:06.470 --> 05:08.540
Umm...

05:08.540 --> 05:11.040
Houx, you are a cruel guy.

05:11.790 --> 05:13.370
It was about one year ago,

05:14.040 --> 05:16.410
when I was going to Santo Yokou.

05:18.620 --> 05:20.050
La La La~

05:22.280 --> 05:24.820
Wahh~ It hurts!

05:24.820 --> 05:25.550
What's the matter?

05:26.620 --> 05:27.070
Hmm?

05:27.590 --> 05:29.390
I see, you fell.

05:30.390 --> 05:33.080
I can't use magic to heal it but...

05:33.560 --> 05:35.820
Pinchin Pui Pui!

05:33.560 --> 05:35.820
Traditional COMICAL "incantation" used in Japan in order to make a injured child feel better

05:37.230 --> 05:38.830
See, it doesn't hurt anymore.

05:44.610 --> 05:47.540
At that time Houx-sama became my prince~ desu.

05:47.540 --> 05:50.430
You see! I wanted to see my prince,

05:50.430 --> 05:52.510
that's why I came from the Magic
world to meet him again.

05:53.050 --> 05:54.000
That's what she says.

05:54.920 --> 05:56.780
I'm sorry. I don't remember.

05:57.290 --> 05:59.350
Houx-sama~

05:59.350 --> 06:01.710
Waffle-sama, got well.

06:02.060 --> 06:03.090
Fantastic!

06:03.090 --> 06:03.710
What?

06:04.060 --> 06:08.460
Because from now on we can have
more destined meetings.

06:08.460 --> 06:10.480
I wonder about that...

06:10.480 --> 06:12.300
She won't give up...

06:12.300 --> 06:13.440
She is pretty strong...

06:13.840 --> 06:19.040
You know...Waffle, I understand your
feelings, but we have to go to school,

06:19.040 --> 06:20.690
so be a big girl and
go back to the Magical World.

06:21.050 --> 06:23.640
I don't want to listen to the fake Houx-sama!

06:25.180 --> 06:26.650
Fake Houx-sama...

06:26.650 --> 06:31.090
Even though we are twins, I have
an official name called Saule...

06:31.090 --> 06:34.320
Well then, it's about time me and
Vanilla headed to school.

06:34.320 --> 06:35.160
Yeah, yeah.

06:35.560 --> 06:40.700
Vanilla and I are Queen Candidates and
we are the middle of our exams.

06:40.700 --> 06:44.430
Saule and I have a job as a knight
that protects those two.

06:44.430 --> 06:45.680
See you later!

06:45.680 --> 06:47.600
Ahh!... Houx-sama!

06:49.470 --> 06:50.740
Wait please!

06:57.450 --> 06:58.210
See you later!

06:58.750 --> 07:00.130
Hey!

07:00.720 --> 07:02.180
Nana, good job!

07:02.560 --> 07:06.110
I will go to the same school as Houx-sama!

07:07.990 --> 07:13.830
Waffle, you're from the Magical World, you
can't suddenly enter a human school.

07:13.830 --> 07:15.720
There are a lot of procedures to be made.

07:15.720 --> 07:16.870
Is that so?

07:17.430 --> 07:21.340
Besides, we are in middle class section and
you are in elementary class section.

07:21.340 --> 07:23.400
We cannot be assigned to the same class.

07:23.400 --> 07:26.720
That's fine. I just want to be near Houx-sama.

07:27.140 --> 07:30.670
Look here Waffle. It was said earlier

07:30.670 --> 07:35.550
Saule and I came to the Human World to protect
those two while in there Queen Candidate.

07:36.580 --> 07:37.680
That's why...

07:38.490 --> 07:39.750
That's why...?

07:40.290 --> 07:42.440
Sorry, but I cannot be your partner.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.160
Sorry.

07:47.430 --> 07:50.950
I, the Housekeeper been working for
Waffle-sama for five years,

07:50.950 --> 07:54.800
and I have deep knowledge about magic.

07:56.600 --> 07:57.370
Here.

07:59.270 --> 08:03.580
Ahh... Ahh... It feels good.

08:03.580 --> 08:05.750
Hey, Nana! Jeez!

08:06.750 --> 08:08.750
Put more into to the lower back.

08:11.750 --> 08:14.690
Jeez, everybody left me.

08:21.760 --> 08:24.650
Give up on Chocolat.

08:26.970 --> 08:30.270
You like Chocolat, right?

08:30.270 --> 08:31.200
So what?

08:32.370 --> 08:34.400
You aren't fit for her.

08:35.080 --> 08:36.660
What do you know?

08:37.410 --> 08:41.410
It's a matter of time until I get her heart.

08:41.720 --> 08:42.450
What?!

08:50.860 --> 08:52.990
Well, keep doing your best.

08:57.030 --> 08:58.570
Nana, did you hear that?

08:58.570 --> 09:00.470
Yes I did,

09:00.470 --> 09:04.100
it seems Houx-sama likes Chocolat.

09:04.610 --> 09:09.910
Jeez, that Queen Candidate named Chocolat
is playing with Houx-sama's heart.

09:09.910 --> 09:11.010
I bet that's it!

09:11.010 --> 09:15.280
I see. Waffle-sama, what a magnificent reasoning.

09:15.280 --> 09:18.410
That's why he is a little bit cold toward me.

09:18.410 --> 09:19.890
So it seems.

09:20.390 --> 09:27.290
But, that guy named Pierre also seems
to want to get Chocolat's heart.

09:27.830 --> 09:30.200
I will not forgive Chocolat!

09:30.200 --> 09:31.100
Oh, wait!

09:31.100 --> 09:35.630
If that's the case, Chocolat should just
like anyone who is not Houx...

09:36.300 --> 09:38.340
Don't tell me Waffle-sama...

09:38.740 --> 09:40.850
When Houx is rejected by Chocolat and feels down,

09:40.850 --> 09:45.850
Waffle-sama will come and fix his heart.

09:46.810 --> 09:47.850
Is it bad?

09:48.520 --> 09:52.350
I am really weak toward your "dame".

09:52.350 --> 09:53.650
Then, cooperate.

09:54.220 --> 09:56.610
I understand.

10:02.030 --> 10:03.970
What's wrong, Chocolat-chan?

10:03.970 --> 10:07.370
I just had a bad feeling.

10:21.320 --> 10:24.020
Huh? I smell something nice.

10:24.020 --> 10:27.190
Really! It's a waffle stand.

10:27.190 --> 10:28.740
Ahh! It's cute!

10:29.260 --> 10:31.560
Looks delicious! Let's take a look!

10:31.560 --> 10:33.060
Chocolat-chan!

10:33.060 --> 10:33.520
What?

10:33.890 --> 10:38.370
Earlier you said you had a bad
feeling. Let's go home quickly.

10:38.370 --> 10:40.370
What... It's fine, it's fine.

10:40.940 --> 10:42.740
Ahh! It all looks delicious.

10:43.040 --> 10:45.340
I can't hold it anymore, I'm going to eat!

10:45.340 --> 10:46.500
Me too!

10:48.000 --> 10:49.750
Welcome!

10:50.140 --> 10:51.750
I want a strawberry one please!

10:51.750 --> 10:52.950
Me too.

10:52.950 --> 10:54.520
For me banana~

10:54.520 --> 10:56.320
I think I'm going to get the melon one.

10:56.320 --> 10:58.270
Haa! I can't decide...

10:58.590 --> 11:03.010
For people like you, we have "Waffle
Special", a combination of all of them.

11:03.360 --> 11:06.260
I'll take that! Vanilla, let's eat together.

11:06.790 --> 11:07.600
Yes.

11:08.760 --> 11:10.630
Understood.

11:11.070 --> 11:11.770
Nii.
(sound for smile)

11:11.950 --> 11:12.600
Nii.
(sound for smile)

11:13.370 --> 11:16.070
Nana's special love-love essense.

11:20.880 --> 11:22.510
Sorry to keep you waiting.

11:23.380 --> 11:24.710
Looks delicious!

11:26.010 --> 11:26.910
Giku!
(expression of bad feeling)

11:27.550 --> 11:29.380
What's wrong, Chocolat-chan?

11:29.380 --> 11:31.820
I just got another bad feeling.

11:32.350 --> 11:35.060
Whatever, I'll eat.

11:36.620 --> 11:37.340
Yes!

11:37.660 --> 11:39.790
Wahh! Taste good!

11:39.790 --> 11:40.800
Huh?

11:43.300 --> 11:43.800
Huh?

11:47.470 --> 11:49.850
My heart is beating faster.

11:50.640 --> 11:51.400
Why?

11:52.040 --> 11:53.110
Chocolat-chan...?

11:53.940 --> 11:56.150
Ahh... What are you guys doing?

11:56.610 --> 11:58.680
Is it alright for you to drop in on the way home?

11:58.680 --> 12:01.350
I'm also getting hungry.

12:02.720 --> 12:04.520
Mimura looks cool!

12:05.020 --> 12:06.220
Kaiji is dreamy!

12:06.720 --> 12:08.050
Akira, cute!

12:08.620 --> 12:10.340
Lovely!

12:16.100 --> 12:18.840
Why is my heart beating faster?

12:19.270 --> 12:22.090
Chocolat-chan... what could be~ huh?

12:23.340 --> 12:25.310
That's Waffle-chan.

12:26.050 --> 12:29.810
Plan worked! Chocolat is head over heels in love.

12:31.480 --> 12:37.420
If Chocolat-chan falls in love with others,
then Houx is going to be mine!

12:37.740 --> 12:39.260
Huh? Is that how it is?

12:43.160 --> 12:46.360
What should I do? Everyone looks dreamy.

12:46.360 --> 12:48.300
Chocolat, what's wrong?

12:48.300 --> 12:50.600
Your face looks red.

12:50.600 --> 12:54.100
Kato, do you have a fever?

12:56.200 --> 13:00.330
Akira, you are SUPER kind. Take my heart.

13:01.880 --> 13:03.960
You can't give away your heart!

13:04.500 --> 13:05.680
Akira~!

13:06.290 --> 13:11.220
Chocolat-chan, if a witch gives away her
heart, she will die! Did you forget that?

13:11.920 --> 13:13.690
What are you two doing?

13:16.940 --> 13:18.860
Please receive my hea~

13:18.860 --> 13:20.030
AHHH!

13:20.030 --> 13:21.960
Let's go home!

13:21.960 --> 13:23.950
Everyone!

13:24.300 --> 13:26.730
Speaking of which, just earlier...

13:26.730 --> 13:28.030
Kato gave us a kiss.

13:28.670 --> 13:29.800
What was that?

13:34.980 --> 13:36.940
Chocolat-chan are you ok?

13:36.940 --> 13:42.180
Huh? I'm totaly fine, my heart is still beating a bit...

13:42.180 --> 13:43.880
Yo! Chocolat, did something happen ~ kero?

13:44.590 --> 13:48.090
Duke, that strip pattern looks nice!

13:49.590 --> 13:51.810
You just noticed that?

13:51.810 --> 13:53.060
Sorry, Duke!

13:53.390 --> 13:55.350
Keroooo~

13:59.130 --> 14:02.320
Babies, shall we go outside for a meal?

14:03.590 --> 14:06.320
Robin, you are so sexy!

14:07.710 --> 14:10.830
No, Chocolat-chan, don't look at any man.

14:11.810 --> 14:12.950
Lovely~

14:15.150 --> 14:17.820
There is a smell of "love love essence".

14:17.820 --> 14:20.330
Chocolat, did somebody give it to you?

14:21.190 --> 14:22.340
That's right.

14:22.890 --> 14:26.100
From the smell of it, it doesn't seem to be that strong,

14:26.100 --> 14:30.430
but for today any man whom she sees, she will fall in love with immediately.

14:31.030 --> 14:36.440
It may wear off tomorrow. She should
not leave home for today.

14:36.440 --> 14:36.940
Yes!

14:37.910 --> 14:39.410
Then, I will leave.

14:40.670 --> 14:41.190
Huh?

14:43.040 --> 14:44.110
We're home!

14:46.210 --> 14:47.550
Houx! Saule!

14:47.550 --> 14:50.750
No! Both of you leave.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.950
Eh? Waffle did?

14:56.690 --> 15:01.300
Houx, because you did not acknowledge
Waffle's feelings, this thing happened.

15:01.300 --> 15:02.730
Saule...

15:02.730 --> 15:05.300
But the effect is going to fade tonight, right?

15:05.300 --> 15:08.100
Good thing she did not meet Pierre.

15:08.100 --> 15:09.010
That's true.

15:09.400 --> 15:13.710
Now, if Chocolat sees Pierre,
he will easily take her heart.

15:14.480 --> 15:15.720
Nana, did you hear?

15:16.010 --> 15:21.750
Yes, Pierre, the handsome guy that was
competing with Houx for Chocolat this morning.

15:21.750 --> 15:22.620
Be.

15:22.620 --> 15:23.220
Be?

15:23.220 --> 15:24.790
Do you remember Pierre?

15:24.790 --> 15:25.490
Be.

15:25.490 --> 15:27.730
Well, can you search where he might be?

15:27.730 --> 15:29.740
Be~!

15:30.160 --> 15:33.990
Now, how can we lure Chocolat?

15:33.990 --> 15:40.230
Hehehe, Waffle-sama, I just
came up with a good idea.

15:45.410 --> 15:49.080
I won't let any man get close to Chocolat today.

15:51.450 --> 15:55.050
Huh? I feel kind of sleepy all of the sudden.

16:02.060 --> 16:05.730
It seems like my heart is
always beating hard.

16:07.390 --> 16:10.430
Why are you here? Pierre...

16:13.500 --> 16:16.580
I came here to take you on a date ~ de gojarimasu.

16:16.860 --> 16:19.590
Pierre, it seems your voice is weird,

16:20.510 --> 16:23.290
but that part Pierre is wonderful!

16:23.680 --> 16:25.630
Now, let's go de gojarimasu.

16:25.630 --> 16:29.640
That "gojarimasu" has a great feeling to it!

16:34.050 --> 16:35.640
Over there, isn't it?

16:39.330 --> 16:41.560
Now, return to where Nana is.

16:44.830 --> 16:46.610
Excuse me!

16:47.840 --> 16:51.820
Umm... there is a girl that wants to meet you, and....

16:59.850 --> 17:02.900
Pierre looks cool riding on a Musasabi.

17:12.790 --> 17:18.560
As expected, using a transformation spell for so long is too hard for an old lady like me.

17:19.770 --> 17:22.670
Geh! Waffle's housekeeper?!

17:22.670 --> 17:23.670
This way.

17:25.470 --> 17:27.980
Heh? Pierre?

17:28.710 --> 17:30.480
This one's the real one.

17:30.980 --> 17:33.350
So the one who wanted to meet me was Chocolat.

17:34.420 --> 17:36.520
I also wanted to talk to you.

17:37.020 --> 17:38.740
Well then, enjoy your time.

17:39.250 --> 17:44.320
What have you done! Do you know Pierre's identity!?

17:44.320 --> 17:45.540
Chocolat.

17:48.030 --> 17:52.070
No, If I look at Pierre now, my heart
will be definitely taken away.

17:52.870 --> 17:54.550
Chocolat, I'm sorry for before.

17:56.550 --> 18:00.550
I can't, Pierre is an ogre and I can't get close, but...

18:01.040 --> 18:04.180
I wanted to apologize to you about
what happened at the aquarium.

18:04.980 --> 18:08.180
I shouldn't have suddenly tried to take your
heart. I should not have done that.

18:10.080 --> 18:11.070
Pierre...

18:14.990 --> 18:16.570
I have a favor to ask of you.

18:16.990 --> 18:17.420
Huh?

18:21.460 --> 18:22.030
Chocolat.

18:26.470 --> 18:28.170
P-Pierre.

18:29.800 --> 18:32.380
Could you please become our Queen?

18:32.710 --> 18:33.470
Huh?

18:33.940 --> 18:36.380
Pierre's Queen?

18:37.310 --> 18:40.280
That way, we won't have to have a quarrel.

18:44.020 --> 18:48.150
What should we do? I don't know
where Chocolat-chan went to!

18:48.690 --> 18:50.060
Let's search for her quick!

18:50.060 --> 18:50.560
Yes!

18:54.860 --> 18:57.730
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune.

19:02.870 --> 19:03.760
Wand!

19:06.710 --> 19:07.870
Alright!

19:09.180 --> 19:11.080
Fluer Spiral.

19:19.420 --> 19:20.740
It's pretty.

19:21.120 --> 19:24.630
What am I doing, making it beautiful?

19:24.630 --> 19:27.250
I can't stop this feeling.

19:27.660 --> 19:30.980
Chocolat, this is your feelings, isn't right?

19:31.600 --> 19:37.990
Even I don't know... is this because of
the love-love essence? Or is it...?

19:38.770 --> 19:42.950
What!! Pierre was an Ogre!?

19:43.480 --> 19:45.330
Waffle, can't you do something?

19:48.820 --> 19:49.480
Is it over there?

19:51.150 --> 19:51.950
Pierre.

19:52.550 --> 19:53.390
Chocolat.

19:53.990 --> 19:54.850
Chocolat!

19:56.960 --> 19:57.890
Don't!

19:57.890 --> 20:06.220
You two again? Don't get close. Chocolat
is mine. And she is our Queen-to-be.

20:06.570 --> 20:08.100
Don't misunderstand!

20:08.100 --> 20:11.460
She is just taking out her heart because
of the love-love essence's power.

20:12.010 --> 20:16.840
That's wrong. I know, these are
Chocolat's true feelings.

20:19.110 --> 20:20.490
True feelings.

20:21.450 --> 20:22.380
Chocolat!

20:23.220 --> 20:26.190
Here, eat these cookies.

20:37.010 --> 20:37.960
I...

20:37.960 --> 20:39.430
Chocolat-chan!

20:39.430 --> 20:42.880
This cookie invalidates love-love essence.

20:43.540 --> 20:45.640
Now you understand, Pierre.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.540
Chocolat is not yours.

20:47.980 --> 20:49.180
Let's go home, Chocolat.

20:49.510 --> 20:55.650
Wait! What do you mean that if I become the
Ogre's Queen, there will be no quarrels?

20:56.120 --> 21:00.390
What are you saying Chocolat! Chocolat
will become Le Royaume's Queen.

21:00.390 --> 21:03.200
Thats right, she can't become the Ogre's Queen!

21:03.960 --> 21:10.700
Chocolat, someday you will understand
what I mean. See you.

21:19.070 --> 21:24.580
I'm sorry! I didn't know Pierre was a wizard.

21:24.580 --> 21:28.080
It's alright. It just shows how much you like Houx.

21:28.080 --> 21:31.100
It's late already. I think it's better for
you to return to the Magical World.

21:31.100 --> 21:34.290
Waffle-sama, she is right.

21:35.260 --> 21:36.480
Yes~

21:37.020 --> 21:38.160
Waffle, see you later.

21:38.860 --> 21:41.260
If it alright if I come see you again?

21:42.030 --> 21:44.000
Yes, come again.

21:44.000 --> 21:45.070
Saule...

21:45.070 --> 21:46.450
Yay!

21:49.840 --> 21:54.850
I won't give up! I will steal Houx
from Chocolat no matter what!

21:55.240 --> 21:57.430
Houx-sama, until then...

22:02.620 --> 22:05.820
Even though I decided that I won't fall for Pierre...

22:07.320 --> 22:12.360
Those feelings from before... Was that
because of love-love essence?

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:45.540 --> 23:48.630
Hey everyone! Who are you going to give chocolates to?

23:48.630 --> 23:52.160
It has nothing to do with me since there is no one I really like.

23:52.160 --> 23:55.530
No way I will give it to Pierre!

23:55.530 --> 24:00.290
But when I think of him, my heart starts beating faster.

24:00.290 --> 24:04.440
I know! I will seal those feelings in a chocolate.

24:04.440 --> 24:06.670
Then my bewilderment might disappear.

24:07.450 --> 24:09.410
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:09.410 --> 24:11.740
Chocolat! Sentiments filled in the chocolate

24:11.740 --> 24:14.180
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!
